This harness benchmarks context-optimization middleware. It imports Jettison
(https://github.com/jettison-ai/jettison), which in turn builds on components
derived from Headroom (https://github.com/headroomlabs-ai/headroom), also
licensed under Apache 2.0. Neither project is affiliated with or endorsed by
the other.

The benchmark configurations under configs/ and the task definitions under
tasks/ are original work authored for this harness. They are synthetic
fixtures modeled on real-world agent setups; they contain no proprietary or
third-party content.
